## Acceptance boundary

The absent statistics-event gap is closed. Subscriber-specific log envelope and
formatting remain backend-dependent; broad P18-V01 public API/settings/input/
error/control-flow and reverse-export reconciliation remains open. Native
Windows runtime, current-revision remote CI, and Phase 19 Broker/Docker
validation were not run. No plan was edited, no push or remote CI was run, and
the four user-owned Phase 19 worktree paths remain untouched and unstaged.
